\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Kristianstads DFF\"><img alt=\"Kristianstads DFF\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstads_DFF\" title=\"Kristianstads DFF\">Kristianstads DFF</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:78.194%;left:35%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Linköpings FC\"><img alt=\"Linköpings FC\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköpings FC</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:96.875%;left:18.451%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"LdB FC Malmö\"><img alt=\"LdB FC Malmö\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd\" title=\"FC Rosengård\">LdB FC Malmö</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:29.861%;left:76.761%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Piteå IF\"><img alt=\"Piteå IF\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF\" title=\"Piteå IF\">Piteå IF</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:71.944%;left:54.437%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Tyresö FF\"><img alt=\"Tyresö FF\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;top:5px;left:-3em\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Tyres%C3%B6_FF\" title=\"Tyresö FF\">Tyresö FF</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:41.736%;left:66.197%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Umeå IK\"><img alt=\"Umeå IK\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK\" title=\"Ume